---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="" description="Navis Maritime Solutions, Dubai: project management, shipyard representation, class-approved marine spare parts and engineering consultancy for shipowners, operators and shipyards." nav="home" page="home">

  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-photo"><div class="mf"><video class="hero-video" autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="metadata" data-src="/videos/hero-ship.mp4" data-src-m="/videos/hero-ship-m.mp4" poster="/images/hero-ship.jpg" aria-hidden="true"></video></div></div>
    <div class="hero-inner"><div class="wrap grid">
      <div class="rise">
        <span class="tag welcome"><span class="w1">Welcome to</span><span class="w2">Navis Maritime Solutions</span></span>
        <h1>Engineered to execute. <em>Trusted to deliver.</em></h1>
      </div>
      <div class="glass plate rise">
        <p>Navis Maritime bridges the gap between complex marine engineering, shipyard operations and asset owner commercial interests.</p>
        <div class="btns"><a class="btn plate" href="/services/">Our services <span class="ar">→</span></a></div>
      </div>
    </div></div>
  </section>
  <div class="body">
    <section class="sec reveal">
      <div class="wrap split">
        <div>
          <span class="eyebrow">Who we are</span>
          <h2>More than a service provider. An elite technical partner on the ground.</h2>
          <p>In an industry where a single day of unexpected downtime or an unresolved technical variance can cost thousands, you need more than just a service provider - you need an elite technical partner on the ground.</p><p>We provide shipowners, ship operators and international shipyards with end-to-end project management, class-approved marine equipment supply and engineering-backed shipyard representation. From the initial lines plan to the final shipyard invoice sign-off, Navis Maritime Solutions protects your capital, mitigates operational risk and ensures your fleet returns to sea on schedule, fully compliant and optimized for performance.</p>
          <div class="facts"><span>Licensed operations in Dubai</span><span>IACS &amp; IMO compliant supply</span><span>From lines plan to final sign-off</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="ph-wrap"><div class="ph plate"><img src="/images/intro-drydock.jpg" alt="Vessel in dry dock" style="object-position:40% 60%"></div></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="sec vm-band vm-ship reveal">
      <div class="wrap vm2 vm-gap">
        <div class="vm-card plate"><h3>Our vision</h3><p>To be the premier global anchor for maritime project execution, recognized for seamlessly bridging engineering precision, shipyard operations and asset owner commercial interests to deliver high-performance, future-ready vessels.</p></div>
        <div class="vm-card plate"><h3>Our mission</h3><p>To safeguard shipowners capital and assets through world-class project management, certified marine equipment supply and elite technical representation. By combining rigorous engineering oversight with transparent shipyard collaboration, we eliminate operational friction, control dry-docking costs and ensure every vessel returns to sea on schedule, fully compliant and commercially optimized.</p></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="sec reveal pillars-sec">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="sec-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">The Navis Commitment</span><h2>Four pillars behind every engagement</h2></div><p>We do not just manage timelines; we manage technical complexity. Every engagement we undertake is driven by four core professional pillars.</p></div>
        <div class="pillars">
          <div class="pillar plate"><div class="n">1</div><h3>Operational Transparency &amp; Cost Integrity</h3><p>Your eyes and ears on the shipyard floor, with data-driven cost validation.</p></div><div class="pillar plate"><div class="n">2</div><h3>Uncompromising Classification Standards</h3><p>Every drawing and component meets IACS rules and IMO mandates.</p></div><div class="pillar plate"><div class="n">3</div><h3>Zero-Downtime Supply Chain Excellence</h3><p>Certified, class-approved equipment and critical spares, sourced with urgency.</p></div><div class="pillar plate"><div class="n">4</div><h3>Engineering-Backed Execution</h3><p>Naval architecture support and on-site representation, working as one.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="sec navyband reveal svc-show" aria-roledescription="carousel" aria-label="Our services">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="sh-head">
          <div><span class="eyebrow">Our core services</span><h2>Eight services. One partner.</h2></div>
          <a class="btn dark plate" href="/services/">All services <span class="ar">→</span></a>
        </div>
        <div class="sh-stage">
          <div class="sh-media plate">
            
            <div class="sh-slide on" data-i="0" aria-hidden="false">
              <img src="/images/svc-project.jpg" alt="Project Management Services" style="object-position: 50% 50%">
              <div class="sh-cap">
                <span class="sh-k">Service 1 <i>/ 8</i></span>
                <h3>Project Management Services</h3>
                <p>Your dedicated on-site technical and commercial proxy for newbuilds, retrofits, conversions and dry-docking.</p>
                <a class="btn plate" href="/services/project-management/" tabindex="0">Read more <span class="ar">→</span></a>
              </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="sh-slide" data-i="1" aria-hidden="true">
              <img src="/images/svc-shipyard.jpg" alt="Shipyards Agent &amp; Representative" style="object-position: 50% 50%">
              <div class="sh-cap">
                <span class="sh-k">Service 2 <i>/ 8</i></span>
                <h3>Shipyards Agent &amp; Representative</h3>
                <p>Official commercial partner for premier shipyards, with direct access to secured drydock slots.</p>
                <a class="btn plate" href="/services/shipyard-agent/" tabindex="-1">Read more <span class="ar">→</span></a>
              </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="sh-slide" data-i="2" aria-hidden="true">
              <img src="/images/svc-spares.jpg" alt="Spare Parts Supply &amp; Support" style="object-position: 50% 50%">
              <div class="sh-cap">
                <span class="sh-k">Service 3 <i>/ 8</i></span>
                <h3>Spare Parts Supply &amp; Support</h3>
                <p>Genuine OEM and certified aftermarket parts, delivered to your port.</p>
                <a class="btn plate" href="/services/spare-parts/" tabindex="-1">Read more <span class="ar">→</span></a>
              </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="sh-slide" data-i="3" aria-hidden="true">
              <img src="/images/svc-engineering.jpg" alt="Engineering Consultancy in Shipbuilding" style="object-position: 50% 50%">
              <div class="sh-cap">
                <span class="sh-k">Service 4 <i>/ 8</i></span>
                <h3>Engineering Consultancy in Shipbuilding</h3>
                <p>An end-to-end engineering pipeline for newbuild designs and complex conversions.</p>
                <a class="btn plate" href="/services/engineering/" tabindex="-1">Read more <span class="ar">→</span></a>
              </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="sh-slide" data-i="4" aria-hidden="true">
              <img src="/images/svc-representation.jpg" alt="Global Product Representation" style="object-position: 50% 50%">
              <div class="sh-cap">
                <span class="sh-k">Service 5 <i>/ 8</i></span>
                <h3>Global Product Representation</h3>
                <p>Your outsourced regional sales force for marine equipment and software.</p>
                <a class="btn plate" href="/services/product-representation/" tabindex="-1">Read more <span class="ar">→</span></a>
              </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="sh-slide" data-i="5" aria-hidden="true">
              <img src="/images/svc-chartering.jpg" alt="Ship Chartering Support" style="object-position: 50% 50%">
              <div class="sh-cap">
                <span class="sh-k">Service 6 <i>/ 8</i></span>
                <h3>Ship Chartering Support</h3>
                <p>Chartering support and post-fixture management, acting as your outsourced chartering desk.</p>
                <a class="btn plate" href="/services/chartering/" tabindex="-1">Read more <span class="ar">→</span></a>
              </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="sh-slide" data-i="6" aria-hidden="true">
              <img src="/images/svc-welding.jpg" alt="Marine &amp; Industry Welder and Welding Qualification Advisory" style="object-position: 50% 50%">
              <div class="sh-cap">
                <span class="sh-k">Service 7 <i>/ 8</i></span>
                <h3>Marine &amp; Industry Welder and Welding Qualification Advisory</h3>
                <p>Welder qualification, WPS and PQR with approvals from DNV, ABS, LR and BV.</p>
                <a class="btn plate" href="/services/welding/" tabindex="-1">Read more <span class="ar">→</span></a>
              </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="sh-slide" data-i="7" aria-hidden="true">
              <img src="/images/svc-inspection.jpg" alt="Fabrication Inspection Services (QA/QC)" style="object-position: 50% 50%">
              <div class="sh-cap">
                <span class="sh-k">Service 8 <i>/ 8</i></span>
                <h3>Fabrication Inspection Services (QA/QC)</h3>
                <p>Independent third-party inspection from raw material to final coating.</p>
                <a class="btn plate" href="/services/inspection/" tabindex="-1">Read more <span class="ar">→</span></a>
              </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="sh-ctrl">
              <button class="sh-b prev" type="button" aria-label="Previous service">←</button>
              <button class="sh-b next" type="button" aria-label="Next service">→</button>
            </div>
          </div>
          <ol class="sh-list">
            
            <li><button class="sh-item on" type="button" data-i="0"><span class="n">1</span><span class="t">Project Management Services</span><i class="bar"></i></button></li>
            
            <li><button class="sh-item" type="button" data-i="1"><span class="n">2</span><span class="t">Shipyards Agent &amp; Representative</span><i class="bar"></i></button></li>
            
            <li><button class="sh-item" type="button" data-i="2"><span class="n">3</span><span class="t">Spare Parts Supply &amp; Support</span><i class="bar"></i></button></li>
            
            <li><button class="sh-item" type="button" data-i="3"><span class="n">4</span><span class="t">Engineering Consultancy in Shipbuilding</span><i class="bar"></i></button></li>
            
            <li><button class="sh-item" type="button" data-i="4"><span class="n">5</span><span class="t">Global Product Representation</span><i class="bar"></i></button></li>
            
            <li><button class="sh-item" type="button" data-i="5"><span class="n">6</span><span class="t">Ship Chartering Support</span><i class="bar"></i></button></li>
            
            <li><button class="sh-item" type="button" data-i="6"><span class="n">7</span><span class="t">Marine &amp; Industry Welder and Welding Qualification Advisory</span><i class="bar"></i></button></li>
            
            <li><button class="sh-item" type="button" data-i="7"><span class="n">8</span><span class="t">Fabrication Inspection Services (QA/QC)</span><i class="bar"></i></button></li>
            
          </ol>
          <div class="sh-dots" aria-hidden="true"><span class="on"></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="sec reveal partners-home">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="sec-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">Our partners</span><h2>Built on strong alliances</h2></div><p>Navis Maritime Solutions builds high-value alliances across the global maritime cluster to deliver turnkey engineering, execution and supply capabilities.</p></div>
        <div class="pgrid five">
          <div class="pcard plate"><div class="lg plate"><img src="/images/p-precibalance.png" alt="Precibalance logo"></div><h3>Precibalance</h3><div class="role">Dynamic Balancing Machines</div></div><div class="pcard plate"><div class="lg plate"><img src="/images/p-ioe.png" alt="International Offshore Equipment Pte Ltd logo"></div><h3>International Offshore Equipment Pte Ltd</h3><div class="role">Deck Machinery</div></div><div class="pcard plate"><div class="lg plate"><img src="/images/p-cdmarine.png" alt="CD Marine, Monte-Carlo logo"></div><h3>CD Marine, Monte-Carlo</h3><div class="role">Engine Spares</div></div><div class="pcard plate"><div class="lg plate"><img src="/images/p-xtl.png" alt="XTL Marine L.L.C. logo"></div><h3>XTL Marine L.L.C.</h3><div class="role">Yachting Solutions</div></div><div class="pcard plate"><div class="lg plate"><img src="/images/p-praise.png" alt="Praise Adonai Ships &amp; Boats Repairing logo"></div><h3>Praise Adonai Ships &amp; Boats Repairing</h3><div class="role">Dry Docking, Afloat &amp; Anchorage Repairs in UAE</div></div>
        </div>
        <p style="margin-top:36px"><a class="tlink" href="/partners/">Meet our partners</a></p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="sec brochure reveal">
      <div class="wrap br-grid">
        <div class="book" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="book-3d">
            <div class="book-pages"></div>
            <div class="book-cover">
              <div class="bk-photo"></div>
              <div class="bk-body">
                <img src="/images/logo-mark-dark.png" alt="">
                <span class="bk-y">Company profile 2026</span>
                <span class="bk-n">Navis Maritime Solutions</span>
                <span class="bk-t">Engineered to Execute. Trusted to Deliver.</span>
              </div>
              <i class="bk-spine"></i><i class="bk-gloss"></i>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="br-text">
          <span class="eyebrow">Company profile</span>
          <h2>Download our brochure</h2>
          <p>Our services, partners and way of working in one document, ready to share with your technical and commercial teams.</p>
          <div class="btns"><a class="btn dark plate br-dl" href="/brochure/Navis-Company-Profile-2026.pdf" download="Navis-Company-Profile-2026.pdf" data-brochure>Download brochure (PDF) <span class="ar">↓</span></a><a class="tlink" href="/contact/">Talk to our team</a></div>
          <p class="br-note" hidden>Preview only: the brochure PDF will be linked here once it's ready.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
    
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
